	"description": "Isometric forward air base: runway, hardened shelters, hangars, control tower, Patriot, C-RAM, AA guns and tanks on the perimeter, and a configurable air wing (F-15E, F-16C, F-22A, F-35A, A-10C, E-3, KC-46, C-130J, KC-130J, AC-130J, C-17, MQ-9, UH-60, AH-64, UH-1Y) that taxis, takes off and lands. The ground follows the seasons (snow and firs, desert and cacti, green or golden trees). Air defence, tanks and aircraft fire to the beat, Ace Combat style radio subtitles, time of day follows your PC clock.",
